  "details": "https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp\nYoutube-dl has stopped being updated and many developers are starting to switch to yt-dlp as their main development tool.\nyt-dlp can perform the exact same function by changing its name to youtube-dl.exe.\nSince the development of youtube-dl has been stopped for a while, there will be a difference of a few months of updates.\nHowever, it is up to you, the developers, to decide whether it is trustworthy or not.\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)\n\nhttps://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp\nyoutube-dlの更新が止まり、多くの開発者がyt-dlpを開発のメインに変更し始めています。\nyt-dlpはyoutube-dl.exeに名前を変えることで全く同じ機能を果たすことができます。\nyoutube-dlは開発がいったん止まっているため、数か月分の更新の差が出てきます。\nただし、それが信用できるかどうかの判断は開発者であるあなたたちがしてください。",
